---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          <span
            class="grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-md bg-brand-600 text-xs font-bold text-white"
            aria-hidden="true">VN</span
          >
          <span>VisaNav</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          A free, public-interest tool that helps immigrants understand their
          options and find trustworthy, low-cost help.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="Footer" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        <a href="/" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white">Home</a>
        <a href="/directory" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white">Find help</a>
        <a href="/partners" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white">For organizations</a>
        <a href="/directory" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white">Resource directory</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500 dark:border-slate-800 dark:text-slate-500">
      <p class="font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        VisaNav is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-1">
        Information here is general and may not fit your situation. Always
        confirm with a qualified, accredited representative or attorney before
        acting. VisaNav is free — no one should ever ask you to pay to use it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">&copy; {year} VisaNav. Built as a public good.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
